{title: Tumse Milne Ki Tamanna Hai}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Saajan Nadeeem Shravan Saajan91}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Tumse Milne Ki Tamanna,        Hai [F]Pyar Ka Irada Hai
[G]Aur Ek Wada Hain [Am]Jaanam,        Jo [Dm]Kabhi Hum [C]Mile
Toh [G]Zamana Dekhega Apna Pyar,        O Mere [Am]Yaar O Mere Yaar
[Am]Main Shayar Nahi Deewana Nahi,        Main [E]Aashiq Nahi Par [Am]wana Nahi
[Am]Main Shayar Nahi Deewana Nahi,        Main [E]Aashiq Nahi Par [Am]wana Nahi
Mili [Dm]Jabse Nazar Tabse [C]Jaan-E-Jigar,        Mili [Dm]Jabse Nazar Tabse [C]Jaan-E-Jigar
Main [E]Ho Gaya Deewana Main Ho Gaya Deewana
[F]Ab Jaane Kya Hoga [E]Jaan-E-Jana [Am]aa,        [Am]Tumse Milne Ki Tamanna
Hai [F]Pyar Ka Irada Hai,        [G]Aur Ek Wada Hain [Am]Jaanam
[Am]Kya Pata Phir Kaha Kab Mulaakat Ho,        Woh [E]Haseena Se Phir Dil [Am]Ki Baat Ho
[Am]Kya Pata Phir Kaha Kab Mulaakat Ho,        Woh [E]Haseena Se Phir Dil [Am]Ki Baat Ho
Uske [Dm]Jaisi Haseen Maine [C]Dekhi Nahi,        Uske [Dm]Jaisi Haseen Maine [C]Dekhi Nahi
Ro [E]kega Kya Zamana Maine Dil Mein Hai Thana
[F]Mujhko Use Hai Abhi [E]Apna Banana [Am]aaa,        [Am]Tumse Milne Ki Tamanna
Hai [F]Pyar Ka Irada Hai,        [G]Aur Ek Wada Hain [Am]Jaanam
